OL,3,GNEWSABonfire safety plea as tonnes of
OL,4,Afireworks seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in West Yorkshire are being
OL,7,Furged to go to organised bonfire
OL,8,Fevents, rather than have firework
OL,9,Fdisplays in their own gardens.
OL,11,FThe request from West Yorkshire Fire
OL,12,Fand Rescue Service (WYFRS) comes ahead
OL,13,Fof this year's Bonfire Night
OL,14,Fcelebrations.
OL,16,FLast year on 5 November there were 394
OL,17,Fbonfire-related calls to the 999
OL,18,Femergency line, with crews called out
OL,19,Fto 155 incidents, according to a WYFRS
OL,20,Fspokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
