OL,3,GNEWSABonfire safety plea as tonnes of
OL,4,Afireworks seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe service has also asked anyone
OL,7,Fbuying fireworks to ensure they are
OL,8,Ffrom a reputable dealer and are legal
OL,9,Fto purchase, following the seizure of
OL,10,Fmore than 30 tonnes of fireworks in
OL,11,FOctober.
